# Trivy findings accepted for now in images this repo owns (third-party images pinned by digest in Terraform, e.g. the
# WordPress test sidecar). The nightly Image Scan (running images) accepts a finding only with a row in the root
# exception register docs/security/vuln-exceptions.toml (repo AA-CIS-Infra, source trivy); this file mirrors those rows
# with the same expiry so the monthly triage can cross-check them (root SEC-03). Format:
#
#   # <reason: why it is safe for now, and what removes it>
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD

